# The compiled native frontend, at BOTH paths it has been built to. The
# root-anchored `/nativefrontend` chosen when 234301e removed an
# accidentally committed binary recorded the mitigation as a guarantee
# ("now gitignored so the build artifact cannot be re-committed") — it was
# not one: the anchor covers only the repo root, and the same artifact was
# re-committed five days later at tools/nativefrontend/nativefrontend
# (7.5 MB, stale, semantically divergent from the sources beside it —
# pre-merge audit 2026-07-31, findings 10/13). Both paths are listed
# explicitly rather than with a bare `nativefrontend`, which would also
# ignore the SOURCE directory tools/nativefrontend/. Every gate invokes
# `go run ./tools/nativefrontend`; nothing reads a prebuilt binary.
/nativefrontend
/tools/nativefrontend/nativefrontend
/deps/
/side/
